    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d927">

                <pb facs="0727" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg645"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the American Chargé
                        d’Affaires.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-12-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December 2,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Department’s November 10 should be a sufficient response to your November 28,
                    and instruction for your guidance regarding the preferential treatment of
                    European claims and the advisability of sending the circular note.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
